    "how_the_selector_was_reached": "call index does not address a layer on the device: its Nth attention call is not layer N-1, because prefill issues attention per token block too. Two earlier runs of this probe compared the device's layer 0 against the vendor's layer 2 and reported three uncorrelated operands; the structural selector -- live index count, 8 at layers 0 and 1 and 12 at layer 2 -- is what made the index comparison meaningful.",
